Package: rads.data
Type: Package
Title: Data for rads package and other public health uses
Version: 1.0.24
Authors@R: c(
    person("Danny", "Colombara", email = "Data.Request@kingcounty.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("PHSKC-APDE", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Provides reference datasets that are intelligently formatted and ready for analysis.
    Some data are used within rads functions (e.g., icd_nchs113causes) whereas others are simply
    made available for other public health analyses (e.g., occupation_soc_structure_2018).
